{title: Mazhai Varum}
{artist: Suzanne Dmello Joshua Sridhar Veppam}
{key: A}

{c: Verse 1}
[A]Mazhai varum arikuri, en,        [F#m]vizhigalil theriyuthae
[E]Manam indru nanaiyuthae,        ithu enna [D]kaadhala saadha [Bm]la
[A]Pazhaigiya kaalangal,        en [F#m]paarvaiyil viriyuthae
[E]Paadhaigal naluvuthae,        ithu [A#]yaeno [A]yaeno
[A]Un thoalil saayumbodhu,        [F#m]urchaagam kollum kangal
[E]Nee engae engae indru unnai,        [A]thedi thedi paarkira thu
[A]Unnodu pogum bodhu,        [F#m]poo pookum saalaiyaavum
[E]Nee engae endru ennai,        [Bm]kaeta pinbu vaadididuthae!
[A]Ariyaadha vayadhil vidhaithathu,        [E]oooh [A]hhh
[A]Athuvaagavae thaanai valarnthathu,        [E]ooohhhh
[A]Pudhidhaai oru poovum pookaiyil,        [E]oooh [A]hhh
[A]Ada yaaradhai yaaradhai parithatho,        [E]ooohhh
Un [Bm]kaal thadam sendra vazhi,        [F#m]paarthu naanum vandhaenae
Athu [G]padhiyil tholaintha [E]daa
